        "selector": "JSXOpeningElement[name.name='RecoveryBadge'] > JSXAttribute > JSXIdentifier[name!=/^(?:status|style|key|ref|className|style|children)$/]",
        "message": "<RecoveryBadge> doesn't accept that prop. Declared props: status, style."
